&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GIFT City, Gujarat&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a high-energy, execution-oriented Compliance Officer to support and scale our US Stocks business under Groww IFSC, a GAP-licensed entity regulated by IFSCA. This role requires a strong blend of compliance rigor, business tracking capability, stakeholder management, and program execution excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate should be polished, articulate, regulator-facing, and capable of independently owning critical compliance and operational reporting responsibilities for the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance &amp;amp; Regulatory Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and track all key business and compliance metrics for the US Stocks business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure accurate and timely submission of regulatory reports and disclosures to IFSCA and other applicable authorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a key point of contact for regulator interactions, audits, inspections, and ongoing compliance discussions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain strong governance standards across business operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business &amp;amp; Program Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive program management for strategic and operational initiatives within the US Stocks business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate cross-functional execution across compliance, operations, product, and business teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring strong execution rigor to ensure business growth and operational scalability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track progress, identify risks, and ensure timely closure of action items&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired Skills &amp;amp; Attributes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of compliance, governance, and reporting frameworks within financial services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and presentation skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident in regulator-facing interactions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High ownership mindset with strong execution capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and business tracking orientation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to thrive in a fast-paced, high-growth environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Background&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in IFSC/GIFT City entities, capital markets, brokerage, fintech, or international investment products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to regulatory reporting and stakeholder management within regulated financial institutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4–5 years of relevant experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Candidates must already be based in GIFT City or currently working within the IFSC or&amp;nbsp; ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
